  m_text: 'Press ''g'' to instantly increase your level by 1.

    Press ''h'' to
    gain 500 experience points.

    Press ''j'' to instantly kill all enemies.

    Press
    ''k'' to kill the nearest enemy.

    Press ''l'' to force surrounding gems to
    merge the central gem into a rare gem.

    Press''u'' to deal dmg to every enemy
    in scene 20% of there hp

    Press''v'' to use boss summon skill

    Press''1''
    to use boss void skill'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
